{"id": "21-1340-2-4", "zh": "404.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-1341-2-8", "zh": "死亡的名称：maraṇa、kālakiriyā、palaya、maccu、accaya、", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "21-1342-2-11", "zh": "nidhana（非阴性）、nāsa、kāla、anta、cavana。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-1343-2-4", "zh": "405.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-1344-2-6", "zh": "死者：peta、pareta，", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-1345-2-6", "zh": "以及 mata，这三个词通用于三性；火葬的柴堆：citaka、cita；", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "21-1346-2-8", "zh": "火葬场、坟场：āḷahana、susāna；尸体：kuṇapa、chava（非阴性）。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-1347-2-4", "zh": "406.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-1348-2-8", "zh": "kabandha（非阴性）指没有头却仍在动作的躯体；", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "21-1349-2-8", "zh": "sivathikā 则用来指抛弃生尸的坟场。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "21-1350-2-4", "zh": "407.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-1351-2-10", "zh": "俘虏：vandī（阴性）、karamara；pāṇa 则被说成是 asu（生命气息）；", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "21-1352-2-10", "zh": "牢狱：kārā、bandhanāgāra；酷刑：kāraṇā、yātanā。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-1353-2-4", "zh": "刹帝利品终。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "21-1354-2-4", "zh": "408.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-1355-2-10", "zh": "婆罗门的名称：brahmabandhu、dvija、vippa、brahmā、bhovādī、brāhmaṇa；", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "21-1356-2-6", "zh": "通晓吠陀的人：sottiya、chandasa；", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-1357-2-6", "zh": "弟子：sissa、antevāsī（阳性）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "21-1358-2-4", "zh": "409.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-1359-2-9", "zh": "梵行者（brahmacārī）、在家者（gahaṭṭha）、林居者（vanappattha）和比丘（bhikkhu），", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-1360-2-8", "zh": "这四种叫作 assama（生活阶段），用于阳性和中性。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-1361-2-4", "zh": "410.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-1362-2-8", "zh": "一起修习戒等的人，彼此称为 sabrahmacārī（同梵行者）；", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-1363-2-15", "zh": "戒师：upajjhāya、upajjhā；给予依止等的人是 ācariya（老师）（复注作 nissayadāyaka）。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-1364-2-4", "zh": "411.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-1365-2-9", "zh": "先为再生者（dvija）举行入法礼，再教他吠陀，", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "21-1366-2-9", "zh": "连同吠陀的支分和秘义一起传授的人，在婆罗门当中称为 ācariya（老师）。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "21-1367-2-4", "zh": "412.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-1368-2-9", "zh": "传承、传说：pāramparia、etihya、upadesa，还有 itiha；", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-1369-2-12", "zh": "祭祀：yāga、katu、yañña；vedī（阴性）指整治过的祭坛地面。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-1370-2-4", "zh": "413.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-1371-2-9", "zh": "马祭（assamedha）、人祭（purisamedha）、无遮会（niraggaḷa）、", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-1372-2-9", "zh": "掷棒祭（sammāpāsa）、力饮祭（vājapeyya），这些是大祭祀。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "21-1373-2-4", "zh": "414.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-1374-2-12", "zh": "司祭者：itvija（复注作 iditvija）、yājaka；", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-1375-2-5", "zh": "集会成员：sabhya、sāmājika；", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-1376-2-10", "zh": "集会：parisā、sabhā、samajjā，还有 samiti、saṃsada。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "21-1377-2-4", "zh": "415.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-1378-2-9", "zh": "四众是：比丘、比丘尼、优婆塞，", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "21-1379-2-9", "zh": "以及优婆夷；或者也可以说有八众：", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "21-1380-2-4", "zh": "416.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-1381-2-12", "zh": "三十三天众、婆罗门众、刹帝利众、魔众、居士众，", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "21-1382-2-9", "zh": "沙门众，以及四大王天众、梵天众。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "21-1383-2-4", "zh": "417.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-1384-2-10", "zh": "以 gāyatrī 为首、有二十四个音节的那种诗律，", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "21-1385-2-9", "zh": "是诸吠陀的开端，它称为 sāvittī（娑毗底利），共有三句。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "21-1386-2-4", "zh": "418.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-1387-2-9", "zh": "供物的熬煮称为 caru；sujā 指献火供用的祭勺；", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "21-1388-2-10", "zh": "paramanna 就是乳粥（pāyāsa）；供物 habya 又称为 havi。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-1389-2-4", "zh": "419.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-1390-2-11", "zh": "yūpa 指祭柱；钻火用的木头称为 araṇī，用于两性；", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "21-1391-2-10", "zh": "家主火（gāhapacca）、供献火（āhavanīya）、南方火（dakkhiṇaggi），这是三种火。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-1392-2-4", "zh": "420.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-1393-2-8", "zh": "布施的名称：cāga、vissajjana、dāna、vossagga、apadesana、", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "21-1394-2-7", "zh": "vissāṇana、vitaraṇa、vihāyitā、pavajjana。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "21-1395-2-4", "zh": "421.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-1396-2-11", "zh": "五大舍施，是就最殊胜之物（眼睛）、财物，", "confidence": 55}
{"id": "21-1397-2-11", "zh": "子女与妻子、王国，以及肢体来说的。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "21-1398-2-4", "zh": "422.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-1399-2-10", "zh": "食物、饮料、住处、衣服、车乘、花鬘、涂香、", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "21-1400-2-9", "zh": "香、床座、灯明，这是十种施物。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "21-1401-2-4", "zh": "423.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-1402-2-8", "zh": "在死者去世当天为他所做的布施，称为 uddhadehika，用于三性；", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "21-1403-2-10", "zh": "为先祖所做的布施称为 nivāpa；saddha 也是指这种布施，取其信心之义。", "confidence": 55}
{"id": "21-1404-2-4", "zh": "424.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-1405-2-9", "zh": "客人：atithi（阳性）、āgantu、pāhuna、vesika；", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-1406-2-10", "zh": "想要前往别处的人称为 gamika；献给客人的供物：aggha、agghiya。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "21-1407-2-4", "zh": "425.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-1408-2-10", "zh": "pajja 指洗脚水等；āgantu 等七个词用于三性；", "confidence": 55}
{"id": "21-1409-2-10", "zh": "恭敬供养：apaciti、accanā、pūjā、pahāra、bali、mānanā。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-1410-2-4", "zh": "426.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-1411-2-8", "zh": "礼敬：namassā、namakkāra、vandanā、abhivādana；", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "21-1412-2-7", "zh": "愿求：patthanā、paṇidhāna，阳性的 paṇidhi 也是这个意思。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-1413-2-4", "zh": "427.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-1414-2-7", "zh": "ajjhesanā 指以恭敬为先导的请求。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "21-1415-2-4", "zh": "428.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-1416-2-7", "zh": "寻求：pariyesanā、anvesanā、pariyeṭṭhi、gavesanā；", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "21-1417-2-9", "zh": "侍奉：upāsana、sussūsā，以及 pāricariyā。", "confidence": 80}
